=\"￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-93aa208673c384f4END_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-e12a9a222d87f2dfEND_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">BOOK_MOO_MoonriseTowers_NecromanticCodexes</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_MOO_MoonriseTowers_NecromanticCodexes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_MOO_MoonriseTowers_NecromanticCodexes\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">8020a980-0577-4c3a-bee4-d78276ffec73</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:8020a980-0577-4c3a-bee4-d78276ffec73\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:8020a980-0577-4c3a-bee4-d78276ffec73\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>In the basement of <a href=\"/wiki/Philgrave%27s_Mansion\" title=\"Philgrave's Mansion\">Philgrave's Mansion</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-1505&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-125</span></li>\n<li>On the rooftop of <a href=\"/wiki/Moonrise_Towers\" title=\"Moonrise Towers\">Moonrise Towers</a></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>[Stamps in the endpapers indicate this book was once part of the library of the <a href=\"/wiki/High_Heralds\" title=\"High Heralds\">High Heralds</a> when they occupied <a href=\"/wiki/Moonrise_Towers\" title=\"Moonrise Towers\">Moonrise Towers</a>. The librarian's summary reads as follows.]\n</p><p><br>\nVery old scholarly treatise about obscure necromantic tomes and codexes, their mystic and arcane locks, and how to unlock and decipher them.\n</p><p><br>\n[At the end, the librarian appended the following note.]\n</p><p><br>\nUrgent request from 'researcher' Ilyn Toth to borrow this book officially DENIED. Stated 'casual interest' in the notorious <a href=\"/wiki/Necromancy_of_Thay\" title=\"Necromancy of Thay\">Necromancy of Thay</a> is a clear warning sign that his interest is anything BUT casual.\n</p><p>In any event, this isn't even the book he wants, that's the <a href=\"/wiki/The_Tharchiate_Codex\" title=\"The Tharchiate Codex\">Tharchiate Codex</a>.\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714223520\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.046 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.049 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1350/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 26660/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7928/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.010/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 931335/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   39.182      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   39.182      1 -total\n 50.00%   19.592      6 Template:Icon_text\